en  characters was very confusing and the  darkness of the footage definitely  didn't help that funnily enough this  isn't the first time that similar  complaints have surfaced in the predator  franchise one of the many criticisms  levelled at alien versus Predator  Requiem is that much of the action  happens in the dark after a power outage  making it incredibly difficult to  distinguish what's going on in the  action scenes one very widely publicized  deleted scene happened when Olivia Munn  discovered one of her co actors Stephen  wildest regal was a convicted sex  offender the scene in question cast  regal in the part of a stranger who  tries to chat up man's character Casey  in a dog park it was certainly a  sensible move to delete the scene in  question what was lost with the cut was  a longer scene introducing Munz  characters someone who doesn't take any  nonsense from anyone and it also would  have foreshadowed a little more her  later connection with one of the  Predator dogs so I'm guessing the scene  would have been Rashad if the issue had  come to light earlier whether these  alternate endings stories and deleted  scenes would have made the movie any  better is debatable although I have  enjoyed some of black's movies in the  past i think his approach to this  predator movie was flawed it's on record  that when black came onboard the project  as writer and director one of his  conditions was that everything had to be  bigger a bigger budget a bigger scope  more characters more predators more of  everything and i think that led to too  much being crammed into the story on top  of that because there were huge story  changes and extensive reshoots some  crucial aspects just don't make real  sense anymore such as the actions and  motives of the first predator we see in  the film and then  maybe because the whole thing is such a  hodgepodge of original and reshot  footage combined with editing that feels  too fast and frenetic it means that  moments like the death of sterling K  Browns character happens so quickly that  if you blinked you probably missed it so  would you prefer the original ending to  the predator and would you have liked to  have seen any of these deleted scenes in  the final film leave your thoughts in  the comments below and let me know  whether you enjoyed the movie tapleft -  check out my recent nun videos with a  review of the ending + deleted scenes or  tap write my full deleted scenes  playlist if you enjoyed this video don't  forget to leave a thumbs up and a share  would be hugely appreciated - thanks for  watching and see you next time you be  gay movie lovers
 

